<speak>
<prosody rate="108%">Freelancers get paid late.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Sometimes never.</prosody>
<break time="400ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Companies juggle quotes, invoices, and strangers.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">And the platforms in between take ten to twenty percent, and hold the money.</prosody>
<break time="500ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">TaskVault fixes both sides.</prosody>
<break time="700ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">A company splits a project into tasks, each with a budget.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Freelancers apply with their own price, a message, and their skills.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">The company picks one per task, helped by a simple, explainable score.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">The price never enters the score.</prosody>
<break time="700ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">New account, no history?</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">A freelancer you already trust can sponsor them.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">One hop only: only the wallets you follow count, so a ring of fake accounts shows nothing.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">A hint, never a verdict.</prosody>
<break time="700ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Once a freelancer is chosen, the money moves first.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Two signatures in Freighter, and the task's <say-as interpret-as="characters">USDC</say-as> is vaulted in a Trustless Work escrow on Soroban.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Not with the freelancer.</prosody>
<break time="200ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Not with us.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Locked before the first line of code.</prosody>
<break time="700ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">The freelancer delivers a link, and a fingerprint of the work goes on chain.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">The company validates and rates the work, one to five,</prosody>
<break time="200ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">then signs approve and release.</prosody>
<break time="400ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Five seconds later, the freelancer is paid.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">No wire.</prosody>
<break time="200ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">No thirty days.</prosody>
<break time="700ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Nobody gets scammed, on either side.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">A seven-day review window: silence pays nobody.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Disputes are settled on chain by an arbiter who can split the money.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">And a publication deposit: a ghost listing forfeits it to a public guarantee fund.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">We hold no key to your pay.</prosody>
<break time="700ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Built on Stellar.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Freighter is the identity and the signature.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%"><say-as interpret-as="characters">USDC</say-as> settles in five seconds, for under a cent.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Trustless Work escrows run on Soroban.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Every step signed by you, public on <sub alias="stellar dot expert">stellar.expert</sub>.</prosody>
<break time="700ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">TaskVault.</prosody>
<break time="300ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">You name your price.</prosody>
<break time="200ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">The money is vaulted.</prosody>
<break time="200ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">The work gets paid.</prosody>
<break time="500ms"/>
<prosody rate="108%">Built solo for Hack Meridian twenty twenty-six.</prosody>
<break time="700ms"/>
</speak>
